{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47306","headline":"步虚词十首 五 · 吴筠","name":"步虚词十首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扶桑诞初景，羽盖凌晨霞。\n倏歘造西域，嬉游金母家。\n碧津湛洪源，灼烁敷荷花。\n煌煌青琳宫，粲粲列玉华。\n真气溢绦府，自然思无邪。\n俯矜区中士，夭浊良可嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}